n left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Jan Dubský" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/jan-dubsky.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/jan-dubsky.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">U Protelu je poměr cena-výkon skvělý a podpora prvotřídní.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Jan Dubský <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Old Town Hotels, CEO</span></div></div></div></div></div>
